{"counts":{"canonical":6,"context":0,"total":6,"unknown_date":0,"unlinked":0},"events":[{"aliases":["Archaeological Site of Mehrgarh","泥砖","聚落"],"body":[],"categories":["科技","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-bf2f7311a77f802426eb3684","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-bf2f7311a77f802426eb3684","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-5772d60dd6f8b81bb35ec734","summary":"梅赫尔格尔位于今巴基斯坦俾路支省的卡奇平原，靠近博兰山口和博兰河。这里保存了跨公元前第七至第三千纪的长期考古序列，地层深逾十一米。多代居民反复营建泥砖建筑，旧屋遗存被新建筑覆盖，逐渐累积成今天看到的聚落土丘。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前第七至第三千纪","end_year":-2001,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-7000},"title":"梅赫尔格尔群体连续营建泥砖聚落"},{"aliases":["来源未给独立事件专名；据所列遗址、器物或行动描述拟题。","音乐","骨器"],"body":[],"categories":["艺术","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-d11d41a96927b4f4b4dbec85","images":[],"map_reference":{"checked_at":"2026-10-25","kind":"city_reference","label":"贾湖","latitude":33.614398,"license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/","longitude":113.661403,"note":"本条所引原文明确涉及贾湖；地图采用资料支持的地点范围，不表示精确场址或完整路线。 地理补录不代表整条史实已经终审。","precision":"town","role":"材料涉及地点","source_title":"Wikidata Q1688860 · P625","source_url":"https://www.wikidata.org/w/index.php?title=Q1688860&oldid=2545001519"},"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-d11d41a96927b4f4b4dbec85","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-baa2d29a04dc2067ba5cac7e","summary":"贾湖遗址位于河南舞阳，研究将其居住阶段置于约公元前7000至前5700年。发掘所得骨笛用丹顶鹤尺骨制成，既有完整器，也有数量更多的残片。研究介绍的完整笛具有五、六、七或八个音孔，显示制作者能够把天然骨管加工成可产生多个音高的吹奏器。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前7000—前5700年","end_year":-5700,"kind":"duration","precision":"year_range","start_year":-7000},"title":"贾湖新石器时代遗存与骨笛制作"},{"aliases":["Jade Cicada","玉器","动物造型"],"body":[],"categories":["艺术","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-211088c80e4a5ffd37c64cf3","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-211088c80e4a5ffd37c64cf3","record_type":"work","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-264bd8dce47575b7e0a79c13","summary":"中国国家博物馆的史前展览目录把玉蝉列入兴隆洼文化，其文化年代约为公元前6200至前5400年。这个名称表明制玉者已以动物形象为题材制作玉器，为观察东北地区新石器时代的造型活动提供了材料；目录所给的是文化范围，不能据此指定某一件玉蝉的制作年。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前6200—前5400年","end_year":-5400,"kind":"dating_range","precision":"year_range","start_year":-6200},"title":"兴隆洼文化玉蝉"},{"aliases":["Xinglongwa and Zhaobaogou spindle whorls","纺织","纺轮"],"body":[],"categories":["科技","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-a95423997412903ea4cf6ebe","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-a95423997412903ea4cf6ebe","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-7357710d6d174e410102b893","summary":"约公元前6200至前4500年，西辽河地区的兴隆洼、赵宝沟文化中已经使用纺轮。考古研究把它们视为纺线技术的线索：部分器物呈中间穿孔的扁圆形，常见素面，也有由陶片改制者。纺轮的出现和延续，使史前织物虽不易保存，制作纤维线的工具仍能留下痕迹。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前6200—前4500年","end_year":-4500,"kind":"duration","precision":"year_range","start_year":-6200},"title":"兴隆洼至赵宝沟时期的纺轮使用"},{"aliases":["Neolithic Site of Çatalhöyük - UNESCO World Heritage Centre","史前聚落"],"body":[],"categories":["文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["安纳托利亚"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-abeac2e462816082feeec3a2","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-abeac2e462816082feeec3a2","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-8953c2e215c642416ea535fa","summary":"加泰土丘位于安纳托利亚高原南部，由东、西两处遗丘组成。东丘保存了更早的新石器时代居住层，西丘则主要揭示约公元前6200至前5200年的铜石并用时代遗存。两丘的先后关系，呈现人群在同一地区长期定居及文化实践延续、变化的过程。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前6200—前5200年","end_year":-5200,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-6200},"title":"加泰土丘西丘的铜石并用时代文化实践"},{"aliases":["Halaf culture","陶器","植物纹样"],"body":[],"categories":["艺术","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["北部两河流域哈拉夫文化"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-95029cdc61d6831e98065532","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-95029cdc61d6831e98065532","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-6d1513d8fa979a3ffca6691d","summary":"哈拉夫文化大致延续于公元前6100至前5100年，其彩陶广见于两河流域北部。植物图案是其中值得注意的一类装饰，既有花朵，也有枝条、灌木和树木。陶工把自然形象安排在器表的带状或分区布局中，使日用器皿同时成为史前图案设计的载体。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前6100—前5100年","end_year":-5100,"kind":"dating_range","precision":"period","start_year":-6100},"title":"哈拉夫文化陶工在彩陶上绘制植物纹样"}],"revision":"16e2d9bc7dac753e8ae63fc6d7d5464fd2e2ef9bb6dc2e0855171d4b9b35d835","schema_version":"1.0.0","scope":"public_database","sources":[],"time_bounds":{"max_year":2026,"min_year":-10000}}